{"nodes": [{"id": "3106f7e8585b8397", "type": "group", "ratio": 1.7777777777777777, "x": -1240, "y": -200, "width": 2400, "height": 1350, "label": "1"}, {"id": "2c6c5226af93e7ae", "type": "group", "x": 135, "y": -118, "width": 950, "height": 1206, "label": "dvanced canvas"}, {"id": "d036b7046d80a4cf", "type": "group", "ratio": 1.7777777777777777, "x": 1400, "y": -200, "width": 1280, "height": 720, "label": "2"}, {"id": "221217fbc3167f35", "type": "group", "ratio": 1.7777777777777777, "x": 3000, "y": -200, "width": 1200, "height": 675, "label": "3"}, {"id": "49b25e606097572d", "type": "group", "x": 1480, "y": -120, "width": 980, "height": 640, "label": "canvas mindmap"}, {"id": "5f6fc0a5b84a1900", "type": "group", "x": -1185, "y": -118, "width": 1235, "height": 446, "label": "canvas"}, {"id": "ea8c715198b79db0", "type": "text", "text": "主体提供了一个无限大小的画布空间，可将卡片（note）、图片、链接、网页片段等元素自由摆放。\n更加适合逻辑分组，在一个无限画布上面，使用最多就是卡片文字和连接线、分组、对齐\n\n支持节点拖拽、连接线、分组（Group）。\n适用于大纲整理、思维图绘制、项目结构布局。", "styleAttributes": {"textAlign": null, "border": null, "shape": "database"}, "x": -480, "y": -104, "width": 510, "height": 146}, {"id": "64fddf596bb814c6", "type": "text", "text": "### canvas\n\n官方无限画布，基本绘制、连线", "styleAttributes": {"textAlign": null, "border": null}, "x": -1165, "y": 42, "width": 420, "height": 128, "color": "3"}, {"id": "3c4b62ea76edad06", "type": "text", "text": "卡片类型：\n- Note 卡片：引用现有的 Markdown 文件。\n- Text 卡片：直接输入文本。\n- Media 卡片：图片、PDF 等文件。\n- Link 卡片：可嵌入网站链接。", "styleAttributes": {"textAlign": null, "border": null}, "x": -480, "y": 106, "width": 446, "height": 196}, {"id": "e9bafdd28d97f184", "type": "text", "text": "幻灯片功能\n！记得第二个配置项也开启一下【Show \"Set Start Node\" in node pupup】\n- 1、开启配置\n- 2、将对应的区域拖入到 slide 区域\n- 3、标记某一个 slide 幻灯片为 Start\n- 4、使用连线连接，建议修改一下颜色，比如蓝色，比较不明显使用\n- 5、输入命令：Advanced Canvas:Start presentation 开始播放幻灯片\n![image.png](https://obsidian-picture.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/luoblog/20260403001742.png)", "styleAttributes": {}, "x": 155, "y": 680, "width": 905, "height": 360}, {"id": "115223069e0fa621", "type": "text", "text": "### 白板 canvas", "styleAttributes": {"textAlign": null, "border": null}, "x": 860, "y": -720, "width": 420, "height": 120, "color": "6"}, {"id": "11dfec4fbc77fb26", "type": "text", "text": "### 颜色与形状\n\n- 节点可更换背景色，一键区分类型。\n- 节点可切换不同形状（矩形、圆形、菱形等）。\n- 对应不同逻辑：\n    - 圆形一般用作起点/终点\n    - 菱形可代表判断条件（流程图）", "styleAttributes": {}, "x": 155, "y": 382, "width": 720, "height": 220}, {"id": "e9335dc0e1fced88", "type": "text", "text": "### advanced canvas\n\n增强布局、样式、快捷操作", "styleAttributes": {"textAlign": null, "border": null}, "x": 155, "y": -106, "width": 420, "height": 128, "color": "3"}, {"id": "e3fb795edde283bd", "type": "text", "text": "### 连线与箭头增强\n\n- 官方 Canvas 的线条比较单一，Advanced Canvas 增加了多种样式：\n    - 实线、虚线、曲线、直角连接线\n    - 带箭头/双箭头/无箭头\n    - 可选颜色与粗细\n- 连接后还能快速切换线条样式，而不必删除重画。\n\n**操作方法**： 右键连接线 → 选择 **Change Edge Style** → 决定样式和箭头。", "styleAttributes": {}, "x": 155, "y": 64, "width": 700, "height": 280}, {"id": "5fb850b82fa5fdd5", "type": "text", "text": "### canvas mindmap\n\n将 Canvas 用作思维导图", "styleAttributes": {"textAlign": null, "border": null}, "x": 1500, "y": -78, "width": 420, "height": 128, "color": "3"}, {"id": "f29acfa6886a495a", "type": "text", "text": "### canvas mindmap\n\n将 Canvas 用作思维导图", "styleAttributes": {"textAlign": null, "border": null}, "x": 1980, "y": 82, "width": 420, "height": 128, "color": "3"}, {"id": "f34fedb2901dde6b", "type": "text", "text": "### canvas mindmap helper\n\n优化 Mindmap 操作体验", "styleAttributes": {"textAlign": null, "border": null}, "x": 1980, "y": 300, "width": 420, "height": 128, "color": "3"}, {"id": "ab737974a2ca1caf", "type": "text", "text": "### canvas presentation\n\nCanvas → 演示模式\n\n使用前建议设置好快捷键，然后进行使用", "styleAttributes": {"textAlign": null, "border": null}, "x": 3060, "y": -68, "width": 420, "height": 128, "color": "3"}, {"id": "cd2d50465ffc3cf6", "type": "text", "text": "使用感受\n不建议使用，直接使用 advanced canvas 中的幻灯片就行", "styleAttributes": {}, "x": 3060, "y": 116, "width": 620, "height": 84, "color": "#b5a97d"}], "edges": [{"id": "64089332588ff8f4", "fromNode": "64fddf596bb814c6", "fromSide": "right", "toNode": "3c4b62ea76edad06", "toSide": "left"}, {"id": "34ba76f6374cd41d", "styleAttributes": {}, "toFloating": false, "fromNode": "115223069e0fa621", "fromSide": "bottom", "toNode": "49b25e606097572d", "toSide": "top"}, {"id": "a9bb7339bb6f39fe", "fromNode": "5fb850b82fa5fdd5", "fromSide": "right", "toNode": "f29acfa6886a495a", "toSide": "left"}, {"id": "ea5239e11771cf58", "styleAttributes": {}, "toFloating": false, "fromNode": "64fddf596bb814c6", "fromSide": "right", "toNode": "ea8c715198b79db0", "toSide": "left"}, {"id": "8adebbc9dcdf2330", "styleAttributes": {}, "toFloating": false, "fromNode": "115223069e0fa621", "fromSide": "bottom", "toNode": "3106f7e8585b8397", "toSide": "top"}, {"id": "be6dd7c9320c88e6", "styleAttributes": {}, "toFloating": false, "fromFloating": false, "fromNode": "3106f7e8585b8397", "fromSide": "right", "toNode": "d036b7046d80a4cf", "toSide": "left", "color": "5"}, {"id": "6a9925a30ed3e4d6", "styleAttributes": {}, "toFloating": false, "fromFloating": false, "fromNode": "d036b7046d80a4cf", "fromSide": "right", "toNode": "221217fbc3167f35", "toSide": "left", "color": "5"}, {"id": "2135eb052f03fc3c", "styleAttributes": {}, "toFloating": false, "fromNode": "f29acfa6886a495a", "fromSide": "bottom", "toNode": "f34fedb2901dde6b", "toSide": "top"}, {"id": "7656d9c7d083bec9", "styleAttributes": {}, "toFloating": false, "fromNode": "115223069e0fa621", "fromSide": "bottom", "toNode": "ab737974a2ca1caf", "toSide": "top"}], "metadata": {"version": "1.0-1.0", "frontmatter": {}, "startNode": "3106f7e8585b8397"}}